  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11452</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4601</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;〜、目をつぶって
ボクがどこにいるかわかる？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Shing&gt;!
If you close your eyes,
can you tell where I am?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11812</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4602</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、ソーマリンクでわかるよ。
斜め後ろでニコニコしてる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yup, through our Soma Link!
You're standing behind me and a little
to the left, with a huge grin on your face!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12164</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4603</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ぐふふ〜、当たりっ！
&lt;Kohaku&gt;もわかったよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehehe, got it in one!
&lt;Kohaku&gt;, you can find me too, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4604</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん。ソーマを通して
&lt;Beryl&gt;を感じるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yep! I can sense you
through my Soma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4605</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バカ野郎、遊んでんじゃねぇ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dumbass, this ain't a game!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14756</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4606</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へ〜ん、ボクや&lt;Kohaku&gt;が
&lt;Shing&gt;とリンクして
悔しいでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pfft, you're just jealous that
I'm linked up with &lt;Kohaku&gt;
and &lt;Shing&gt; and you're not!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15540</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4607</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>べ、別にぃ！　俺なんて昔は
何度も&lt;Kohaku&gt;のオネショの
身代わりになってやったんだぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A-As if! I'll have you know
when we were little, I took the fall
every time &lt;Kohaku&gt; wet the bed!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16524</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4608</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>罪を分かちあった兄妹の絆に
比べりゃ、ソーマリンクなんて
大したことねぇっつの！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Your silly little Soma Links are nothing
compared to our bond as siblings!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16988</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4609</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うふふ、そうでしたわね。
わたくしが『おトイレに起きて』って
注意しても起きてくれなくて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe, that's true.
I'd always warn her to get up and
use the bathroom, but she never did.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18332</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4610</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっとぉ〜〜〜っ！
お兄ちゃんもリチアも
何千年前の話をしてるのよッ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>H-Hey, cut it out!
Why even bring that up?
That's ancient history by now!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20244</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4611</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……うぅ、俺たちだって
すぐにリンクしてやるからな！
なぁ、&lt;Kunzite&gt;!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ugh. Well, we're gonna
form a Soma Link, too!
Ain't that right, &lt;Kunzite&gt;?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21056</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4612</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……二千年ぶりに
リチア様の笑顔を確認できた。
これ以上の望みなど、ない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have witnessed Master Lithia smile
for the first time in two-millennia.
I could not wish for anything more.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21984</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4613</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ごめんなさい。
罪人のわたくしに
笑う資格などないのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm sorry.
A sinner such as myself
doesn't have the right to smile.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
